    "physical_source_inhibited_for_motion_stages": true,
    "description": "Six supervised captures correlate exact DA000400 replies with idle, natural execution, panel pause and resume, programmed dwell, and D801 software stop on one Boss LS2040 setup.",
    "limitations": [
      "The status interpretation is scoped to the exact Boss LS2040 setup and capture date; it is not a generic Ruida status-bit definition.",
      "Controller firmware identity was not independently captured, so the evidence does not establish behavior for another firmware revision, controller, machine, transport, or UDP.",
      "Manual panel jogs did not change the returned word; DA000400 therefore does not establish all axis-motion state on this setup.",
      "The legacy moving, job_running, part_end, and unknown_bits fields are preserved as decoder output only and are not treated as generic completion semantics.",
      "In particular, legacy part_end is true throughout the observed paused state and must not be interpreted as completion.",
      "Natural completion requires a same-session idle preflight, successful send, an observed active word, and stable post-active 0x00010600 samples; short jobs whose active state is missed remain unconfirmed.",
      "The single observed 0x00000000 baseline is not accepted as post-active completion evidence.",
      "D801 is only a software process-stop command in this evidence. It is not an emergency stop, a safety-rated stop, or a substitute for machine safety controls.",
      "A stopped job has a cancelled outcome and is not a successful natural completion or machine-hours success.",
      "Post-stop cancellation requires both at least three consecutive 0x00010600 samples and at least 0.600 seconds elapsed since the first stable sample; sample count alone is insufficient.",
      "The physical laser source was inhibited during motion stages, so these captures do not establish emission behavior.",
      "Operator reports were not instrumented metrology and do not establish timing, position, electrical, optical, or safety performance.",
      "Absolute device paths, device identifiers, host paths, and absolute monotonic clock origins are intentionally omitted from this public fixture.",
      "The original captures are content-addressed but not reproduced verbatim because they contain private host and device metadata.",
      "The motion artifacts are content-addressed but are not included in this fixture; their transfer receipts prove host-side transmission, not a controller acknowledgement.",
      "Unknown DA000400 values remain unknown and must fail closed rather than being inferred from individual bits."
    ]
  },
